                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Arcade top-down shooter where you control a robot and battle hordes of enemies across successive levels\n\n✅Dynamic, fast-paced action, intense skirmishes, and the constant need to keep moving maintain the game's momentum.\n✅Various game modes\n✅Diverse enemies ,distinct behaviors and attack patterns force you to adapt your tactics\n✅Wide selection of weapons and abilities,allows for various robot configurations and lets you tailor your combat style to your preferences\n✅Simple graphics\n✅Good price\n\n❌It can become repetitive after a while, as the gameplay consists solely of shooting and dodging successive waves\n❌No graphics settings\n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [b] Good [/b], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game and indie games)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
